OL,3,GNEWSA'Rainham volcano' could continue
OL,4,Aamid legal action
OL,5,
OL,6,FFires at a former illegal waste dump in
OL,7,Feast London, dubbed the "Rainham
OL,8,Fvolcano", could continue for another
OL,9,Ftwo to three years due to potentially
OL,10,Flengthy legal proceedings, according to
OL,11,Fa council report.
OL,13,FArnolds Field on Launders Lane has
OL,14,Fcaught fire more than 160 times since
OL,15,F2018, with nearby residents reporting
OL,16,Fcoughs, itchy eyes and more frequent
OL,17,Fvisits to their  GP.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
