OL,3,GNEWSA'Rainham volcano' could continue
OL,4,Aamid legal action
OL,5,
OL,6,FHavering Council formally designated
OL,7,Fthe privately owned site as
OL,8,Fcontaminated land last October and said
OL,9,Fit could intervene if the owner failed
OL,10,Fto carry out remediation work.
OL,12,FThe landowner - who did not dump the
OL,13,Fwaste there - said his position would
OL,14,F"remain  fully reserved" until any
OL,15,Flegal case had been formed.
